window.products.push({"id":191032,"name":"Turkuoise Peshtemal - Set of 4 - Genuine Flat Woven Turkish Towel - Pareo - Sarong - Picnic Blanket - Yoga Mat - Fouta (100% Cotton) (Diamond-Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pr+7r1EsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peshtemels are thin flat woven cotton towels traditional to Turkey. They are much larger than regular towels, which allows them to perfectly wrap around the body. Due to its generous size, these towels can be also worn like sarong or pareo. At the same time, peshtemals are thin and they take very little space when folded, which makes them perfect for travels or during the trips to the beach. These towels are very versatile: they can be used as bath towels, beach towels, pool towels, picnic blanket, youga mat, sarong, pareo or a light throw for a couch. Towel Bazaar's Peshtemals are made of 100% Turkish cotton and they get softer with each wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pr+7r1EsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TURKUOISE TURKISH TOWEL","source_asin":"B075H4YMRV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075H4YMRV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075H4YMRV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191033,"name":"HOMMLOVE Electric Pepper Grinder, Automatic Salt and Pepper Grinder Set of 2, Battery-Operated Pepper Mill Grinder with Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81is3EoQYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Electric salt and pepper grinder set for kitchen will change your dining experience! Unique Gravity Electric Salt And Pepper Grinder Set Design: Our pepper grinder adopts advanced gravity sensing design, no need manual grinding, no buttons to press.Simply flipped the pepper grinder and you will have fresh ground spices.Electric salt and pepper grinder set suitable for all spices.Such as coriander Seeds, Mustard Seeds, 4 Color Peppercorns, White Peppercorns, Black Pepper,Himalayan Pink Salt, Kosher Salt, Sea Salt and much more.automatic pepper grinder with LED Light will grind your spices to release their freshness . How To Use Pepper Mill Grinder : ①Pepper grinder pepper mill grinder Easy to fill. Just rotate the transparent body part of pepper grinder, put the spices you need to grind in it and then re-rotate it back to the original place to fill it up. ②electric gravity salt and pepper grinder easily adjust. Simply turn the dial clockwise for a finer grind and counterclockwise for a more coarse grind. ③Pepper grinder with Blue LED Light can illuminate the food. The blue light will turn on when you flipping electric pepper grinder, and the light clearly illuminates the food, which helps to prevent the food from being over-seasoned. ④Pepper grinder set easily use. Just fill the spice at the bottom, turn the top to fill the battery, adjust the roughness and then simply turn over the grinder to start grinding. How To Clean Gravity Electric Salt And Pepper Grinder Set: Just wipe down the pepper grinder mechanism(Do Not place the grinder mechanism in Dishwasher)Glass bottle is dishwasher safe. 1.Twist the pepper mill grinder cap counterclockwise to take it off. 2.Rotate and pull open the pepper shaker bottom cover. 3.Twist the coarseness adjusting knob counterclockwise until it comes out. 4.Air dry the parts of automatic pepper and salt mil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81is3EoQYpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMMLOVE","source_asin":"B0B2WPKH2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2WPKH2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2WPKH2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
