window.products.push({"id":191099,"name":"O’Creme Ravioli Maker for 12 Circles Each 1-7/8 Inch (Including Edges), with Non-Stick-Coated Metal Cutting Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419RySPLpEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Get this premium all-purpose ravioli maker from O’Creme and experience Italian-quality foods in the comfort of your own kitchen. Founded by professionals who have spent decades in the culinary and confectionary arts industry, the O’Creme Ravioli Maker was designed to help support cooking everything from quiet kitchen dinners to holiday meals for friends and family. Our non-stick ravioli maker with cutting tray gives you more options for creating fresh, ready-made pasta for all your favorite Italian meals. And with a 12-mold system that lets you make a dozen ravioli casings at once; we’ve even improved food prep time and reduced overall effort for superior kitchen versatility. Getting started is easy. Simply roll out pasta dough into a sheet and then lay it on the metal cutting tray. Press the pasta with the tray creating small cavities for meat or cheese. Do the same over the play try and press down to form the other side. You now have perfect ravioli pieces! Use a rolling pin to cut and seal filled ravioli pieces and pull away excess edges. Cook and enjoy. Product Details: Professional Ravioli Maker Professional Ravioli Maker 12 Pasta Circles (1-7/8\" Each Overall, 1-1/2\" in hollow part that holds your filling) 12 Pasta Circles (1-7/8\" Each Overall, 1-1/2\" in hollow part that holds your filling) Non-Stick Coated Metal Cutting Tray Non-Stick Coated Metal Cutting Tray Non-Skid Rubber Feet for Counter Stability Non-Skid Rubber Feet for Counter Stability Dishwasher Safe and Easy to Clean Dishwasher Safe and Easy to Clean Beginner Friendly Design Beginner Friendly Design Makes a Wonderful Holiday Gift Makes a Wonderful Holiday Gift Includes Easy-to-Follow Guidebook Includes Easy-to-Follow Guidebook Get this premium pasta ravioli maker from O’Creme by clicking Add to Cart above and start expanding your creativity in the kitchen with fresh, homemade Italian meals your family will love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419RySPLpEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O'CREME","source_asin":"B07WZGQ2D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WZGQ2D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WZGQ2D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
