window.products.push({"id":191140,"name":"M. Gastro Kitchens 4 Pcs Set of 15 Cavity Mini Muffin Top Baking Pan, Brownies, Keto Cheese Crisps, 2\" diameter, 3/8\" deep (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s464GkSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We at M. Gastro Kitchens believe that bigger is not always better. We wanted to create a piece of bakeware that produces perfect healthy portions. Silicone is our choice for material. It is durable, food safe and we can make them into some fun, eye-catching colors. MINI MUFFIN TOPS: What's better then muffin tops? Not much...except mini muffin tops. Instead of filling up on 1 flavor, you can make multiple flavors and indulge. Create a 4 pack for your kids to take to school for lunch and after school activities. DON'T LIMIT YOUR CREATIVITY: These are not just for muffin tops. Try making mini brownies, cupcakes, tarts. Scoop in some softened ice cream, flatten with a spatula and re-freeze. Nestle that in to some cookies you baked and viola, ice cream sandwiches. 4 PACK OF TRAYS: Each tray has 15 individual cavities making a total of 60.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71s464GkSJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M. Gastro Kitchens","source_asin":"B07YF2XGPX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YF2XGPX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YF2XGPX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191141,"name":"Perfect-Sousvide \"Pro-LIne\" 6.5 Gal. (26 qt) Polycarbonate Pan, Hinged Lid, Insulation and SVE Rack for Circulator Sous Vide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91y8y-wf9IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our \"Pro-Line\" combines the advantage of a large capacity water bath with energy saving features that extend circulator heating efficiency and save you money. Designed for commercial and \"heavy-use\" consumer application the Pro-Line package is also attractive to home sous vide cooks wanting to save energy and cut cooking costs. The hinged looks great, opens quickly and solves the biggest problem with solid polycarbonate lids: the hot condensate run-off that wets your counter-top (and you if you're not careful). Top insulation sheet can be trimmed with scissors for a precise fit to your brand of circulator and comes with velcro discs for secure attachment to the lid. Clear polycarbonate lid has routed notch that will accommodate most commercial circulators 3.2\" dia. or less including Aicok, Anova, Avalon Bay, Azrsty, BlinBling, Chefelix, Chefsteps Joule, Gourmea, Gramercy, Hompo, Instant Pot, Kaloric, Magicelec, Monoprice, My Sous Vide, Nutrichef, Nokimu Classic, Primo Eats, and SansAire.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91y8y-wf9IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect SousVide","source_asin":"B01FSKPEZM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FSKPEZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FSKPEZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
