window.products.push({"id":191385,"name":"New Japenese Zen Sand Garden | Ideal Desk Decor to Enhance Mindfulness and Practice Meditation During the Day | Bronze Finish with Brown Sand by Exist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZTzlB2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring Mindfulness Into your Work or Home We could all be more mindful. It’s the goal we write down in our journal every day, but when the day ends we all but forget that original intention that we set out to achieve. Exisential’s Zen Garden can be a tool for you to help bring mindfulness into your daily life. With every rake of sand, setting up of the rocks, lighting of incense, you are making a decision to be more mindful. Spark Creativity Each Day with Your Zen Garden In Japanese culture, the Zen garden creates a miniature stylized landscape through carefully composed rocks, sand, and figurines. Classical Zen gardens were created at temples of Zen in Kyoto during the Muromachi period. Just like those Japenese who would attend to their Zen gardens and find bliss, you can as well. Every day you can spark the creativity inside of you by arranging your Zen garden. The sand represents water (you can use your rake to create ripples and rivers), and the rock formations represent mountains and islands — let your creativity flow from your brain and set up your Zen garden every day. What’s Included in the Box: 1 Package of Brown sand  1 Bronze Sandbox Base 1 Bag of Assorted Rocks 1 Bronze Statue 1 Cacti Flower 1 Candle w/ Bronze Candle Holder The Existential 100% Guarantee In creating this Zen sand garden, we believe we have channeled our inner Zen to create a Zen garden kit that you will love. If that is not so, we stand behind our product and will offer you a 100% no-questions-asked refund if you do not reach deeper mindfulness by using it. Breathe in… Breathe Out…. Breathe In… Add to Cart Now… Breathe In…. Breathe Out","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZTzlB2sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Existentials","source_asin":"B07QZ5RTSB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191385","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QZ5RTSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QZ5RTSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
