window.products.push({"id":191392,"name":"ZipIt Opener - Electric Blister Pack & Clam Shell Package Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I15xkJghL._AC_.jpg","description":"Opening clamshell-style plastic packaging can be the ultimate test of patience, strength, and even genius. Eliminate the hassle of fighting with those frustrating seals with help from this clever blister pack/clamshell opener. Designed to slice easily through the otherwise impossible packaging--from consumer electronics and office supplies to toys, cosmetics, fragrances, and more--the unit makes it effortless to neatly and safely dispose of the cumbersome clamshells with the mere touch of a button. Simply remove the tinted plastic safety guard to reveal the unit's razor-sharp roller blades. Firmly gripping the heavy plastic handle, guide the edge of a clamshell or blister package between the durable steel blades while pressing gently on the finger trigger beneath the handle. When arriving at a corner, veer off the edge of the package, rotate it, and continue in the same manner until all four sides release. The compact unit stores easily in a kitchen drawer or toolbox, and it operates on two AA batteries (not included) for cordless convenience and portability. A smart and safe alternative to using scissors and kitchen knives, the blister pack/clamshell opener measures approximately 8 by 4 by 8 inches and carries a 60-day limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I15xkJghL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZIPIT","source_asin":"B001QXOMWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191392","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001QXOMWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001QXOMWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
