window.products.push({"id":191456,"name":"OctoRose Made to fit Any Dining Chair with The arms or Without The arms Upholstery Material Chair Cover Chair Seat Cover, Customize Size Set of Two Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G3irUGEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW TO ORDER 1. Measure your chair seat size. Please refer the image and get A, B, C. D, E, F. Please take a picture to show us your chair style. The default seat skirt height is 4-5\" or so. Please see other image to see how it looks. 2. Pick the color and enter quantity you need.  3. During check out, leave a notes: A , B, C all are in inches. For Canada customer, please leave inches or CM clearly. Please also send me an image of chair seat, we want to know if there is any curve around. This custom make is not eligible for return. If we made mistake, damaged or lost, we take care of it. WARNING: Color may vary from monitor to monitor.  FAQ: 1. Where to make and how long to take? We make in WA, USA. Will ship to US and Canada. We will take 4-7 days to make then ship by UPS or Post office. 2. Special shape Chair? If you have special curved chair seats, then please contact us to see if we can. Chair images will help to understand your chair seat shape.  3. Armed Chair ? If your chairs have arms, then we may need images or drawing from you to tell the position of the arms so that we can cut off to fit. Some arms feet stand in the seat middle while some stand in front.  4. Chair back cover? Yes, we can also make chair back cover according to your chair size. Please send us image of your chair and measurement. We can make back cover to entirely or partially cover the back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91G3irUGEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OctoRose","source_asin":"B074NB217V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074NB217V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074NB217V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191457,"name":"Tim And Ted Gaming Pillow Case Evolution of A Video Game Controller Gift Idea for Nerds White One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aFkyP8m8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The video game controller has evolved so much over the years. Show the evolution of the controller with this cool design! Our T-shirts, hoodies, sweats and other products are all printed to order in the UK, using top quality, digital, full color print technology. Your genuine Tim and Ted product will be lovingly manufactured in the city of Bristol, packed with great care and shipped rapidly to you anywhere in the world. We are confident that you'll love your Tim and Ted branded product, so much so, that we gladly offer a no-quibble satisfaction guarantee as standard. We care about quality, that's why we only use pre-shrunk apparel to eliminate shrinkage and misshaping. Comfort and above all, safety, are our key values. As a result, all of our products comply to the OEKO-TEX 100 standards. We've got your back! Whether its a special occasion or just a treat, with personalized message and wrapping options available for him or her, our Pillow Cases make the perfect gift idea or present for all your friends and family. Why not treat dad to a hoodie for Fathers Day? Or surprise mum with an apron for Mothers Day? Last minute Valentines gift for your boyfriend or girlfriend? We want you to look cool, so check out our other listings for more awesome pillow case designs from birth years, catchy slogans and quotes to the just downright funny. Pillow Cases:* 70% Cotton , 30% Polyester - Egyptian Cotton Collection.* Closely woven fabric.* 200 threads per sq/in for a finer and softer feel.How do I wash my product?To keep your product looking as good as possible, for as long as possible, wash inside-out at 30 degrees Celcius","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aFkyP8m8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tim And Ted","source_asin":"B07YKQM6Q5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YKQM6Q5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YKQM6Q5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
