window.products.push({"id":191649,"name":"Whole House Worlds The Farmer's Favorite 2 Shelf Folding Bakers Rack, Rustic White, Wrought Iron by","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516LrVug1XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Strike the perfect balance of form and function with our Farmer's Favorite Bakers Rack. This country-style wrought iron rack features 2 open-work shelves that offers exceptional convenience by delivering fast, beautiful and easy storage. Soak up the space. Just shy of 3 feet tall at 33 1/3 Inches, with each shelf measuring 9 7/8 inches wide, this lightweight yet sturdy set of shelves weighs in at just 8 pounds. Designed to allow air to circulate, the open work shelves are ideal for placing hot dishes for cooling in a kitchen setting. Organize your outdoor space. Ideal for pool, patio and garden use in summer, and in laundry, kitchens, bathrooms and more in the house. There's no end to the variety of rooms and spaces to place this versatile rack in. Crafted of durable long lasting white wrought iron, this set of shelves is coated with powder that is rust and fade resistant. Easy to set up, simply fold out the sides and place the shelves in the down position. Pile up books, blankets, towels, or whatever you fancy. There's plenty of room here for all your treasures. Ideal for variety of styles, it pairs well with equal ease into beach, mountain, farm and urban chic themes. Enjoy! By Whole House Worlds Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516LrVug1XL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B01DSAFHZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DSAFHZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DSAFHZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191650,"name":"Play at The Sea, Beach Wall Metal Sculptures, Nautical Home Decor, Artwork, Handmade in Haiti from Steel Drum Barrels, 7.5 x 17.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81779QjshDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This sculpture has been finished with a clear enamel coating, which will protect it from the elements. However, if it is displayed outdoors, we recommend applying a spray-on clear coat in order to maintain it's fresh-out-of the box look. Five minutes once a year is all it takes. Easy! Firing, sanding, pounding, chiseling, cutting and shaping, Haitian artists fashion each beautiful recycled metal sculpture by hand. It is a tradition well-established in the village of Croix-des-Bouquets, as fathers have taught sons and neighbor has taught neighbor for four generations.Hanging your metal art is easy, once you know how. Choose a place it within two design elements that are touching or notched toward the center of the piece and drive a nail into the wall at that point. Using a second and possibly a third nail, place those in other notched areas within the design to secure it firmly. Avoid placing nails in the eyes or mouth. A viewer's eye will go straight to those elements and a nail there will draw attention to itself. You don't want the nails to become part of the details - you want them to \"disappear.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81779QjshDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B016VLXC7E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B016VLXC7E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B016VLXC7E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
