window.products.push({"id":191831,"name":"Hot Air Popcorn Maker, Popcorn Popper Machine for Home, No Oil Needed, Healthy for Popcorn Lover, Party Birthday Gift, Yellow-1200W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713aBHTO66L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tiny but mighty: it delivery a large bowl popcorn(at least 60oz for each batch) for your home movie night or parties. Simple to use: Just flick the on/off switch, after 2 minutes, the popcorn will pop into your bowl or popcorn box. A consistent 1200 watts of power makes most kernel popped. Less guilty as no oils required: Pop out fresh and plain popcorn, it is very healthy for kids and popcorn lover. Easy to Clean: The chute and top cover could be cleaned with dry cloth. You don't need to let deep cleaning a popcorn maker cut into your great nights. Add your favorite flavors: The popcorn taste simple, you can add your favorite things like salt,a little butter, or cheese on. It is 100% home made and healthier than those popcorn you bought from store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713aBHTO66L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoolonie","source_asin":"B09KPD84NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KPD84NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KPD84NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191832,"name":"Hyoola Tall Taper Candles - 12 Inch Silver Grey Unscented Dripless Taper Candles - 10 Hour Burn Time - 12 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S7yqa1MwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM QUALITY TALL CANDLES Need something to illuminate your decor at your special occasion? Look no further than our tall taper candles by Hyoola. They exude a warm glow and a long-lasting flame. Our tapered candles are designed narrower on top and wider towards the base which will fit in most standard-sized candle sticks holders. Made of 100% high-quality paraffin wax, our long candles are dipped in layers, for a beautiful smooth finish. Our 100% cotton wick ensures a long-lasting, even burn. PRODUCT FEATURES: 100% Paraffin Wax 100% Cotton Wicks Over Dipped for Smooth Finish Dripless Unscented Made in Europe Perfect for Restaurants, Weddings, and Parties. 3 Sizes: 10” - 8 Hour Burn Time12” - 10 Hour Burn Time14” - 12 Hour Burn Time Available Colors: White, Ivory, Cream, Dark Grey, Woolwhite, Antique Rose, Taupe, Celery Green, Burgundy, Sahara, Turquoise, Terra Orange, Midnight Blue, Fuchsia, Lime, Black, Metallic Gold, Metallic Silver, Metallic Copper, Light Pink, Mauve Pink, Purple, Grey Blue, Ice Blue, Yellow, Orange, Cherry Red, Olive Green, Sage Green, Silver Grey MULTIPURPOSE USE Hyoola’s tapers candles 12-pack equip you for any occasion, whether it be a wedding or celebration, religious observance, and more. Their elegant tapered shape, makes them perfect for church prayers, and other religious rituals as well. Why Are My Taper Candles Dripping? The candle might not be completely vertical. If your taper candle isn't standing straight, it will burn unevenly, which can lead to wax running far down the long candle before it hardens.  There could be a draft, air conditioning, fans, outdoors, window draft, as well as a slight breeze, can also cause the candle stick to burn unevenly and lead to dripping. Ignite your creativity with Hyoola Dripless Candles ! Great quality materials mixed with incredible utility that will brighten your days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S7yqa1MwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hyoola","source_asin":"B097F61CZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097F61CZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097F61CZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
