window.products.push({"id":191847,"name":"Gold Transparent Balloon Boxes With 27 Letters - Baby Shower Decorations For Baby Boy Or Girl - 1st Birthday, Bridal Shower, Gender Reveal Party Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tO82gbmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FUN PARTY DECORATIONS THAT LAST. These Gold baby boxes with letters are perfect for 1st birthday balloons, baby shower or gender reveal decorations, and many more occasions you have on your calendar! 4 pre-folded baby balloon boxes come packed in a sturdy giftbox - easy to store for the next celebration or share with friends and neighbors. LIMITLESS COMBINATIONS FOR ALL CELEBRATIONS. One set of balloon decoration boxes includes 27 letters, plus an extra B letter to spell BABY, and also BDAY, XMAS, GIRL, BOY, LOVE, HOME. Unlike most other brands, we not only include adhesive dots instead of adhesive letters so that you could use the letters multiple times. We also attach a special downloadable letter book, so you’ll never run out of them! VERSATILE FOR BOYS AND GIRLS. Our transparent boxes with letters can be used as baby shower decorations for both baby boy and baby girl. The baby decor boxes are loved by adults and kids and serve as an ideal party backdrop and prop for a photo booth. It has never been so easy to create a festive setup indoors or outdoors, backyard party or birthday picnic in the park. ONE LESS THING TO WORRY ABOUT BEFORE YOUR SPECIAL DAY. Be it party decorations, color matching, or background props, we have you covered. The assemble video and manual with high-quality pictures take one trouble away. The party balloon boxes come with a colorful PDF manual to provide you with trendy combinations of matching colors such as rose gold, pink and gold, or black and gold. LIFETIME GUARANTEE. We are responsible for making your party decorations stand out and serve multiple times. Try it yourself and you will know better! If for any reason you are not happy with our product, just send it back to us and we will refund you the full purchase price. No questions asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tO82gbmaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leib Games","source_asin":"B09N96SD1G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N96SD1G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N96SD1G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
