window.products.push({"id":191866,"name":"Placemats Set of 6, Faux Leather Place Mats with Coasters, Waterproof, Stain Resistant, Heat Resistant, Easy to Clean PU Table Mats for Dining Table a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O2im5CMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package and Size - Set of 6 Placemats and 6 coasters, The placemat is 17.3 x 11.8 inches (44x30cm), The round coaster is diameter 3.9 inches (9.9cm). The large size is more suitable for indoor gatherings and outdoor picnics. It can effectively protect your tables and counters from stains, spills, and scratches. Material - Placemats are made of faux PU leather, soft and comfortable, The surface double-texture design increases the anti-skid ability and heat insulation. These place mats can withstand temperatures up to 176°F（80°C）and they perfectly protect your tabletop from scalding and slipping. No solids and liquids can soak through the table placemats. Multi-Purpose Placemat - Flexible and Durable, These placemats are suitable for everyday indoor and outdoor dining experiences. Very suitable for any situation, such as your home décor, dinner or coffee table, office, study, coffee shop, restaurant, hotel. Easy to Clean - Washable & Wipeable Placemats, Simply wipe the mats with a clean damp cloth or paper when there is liquid or seasoning on it, and they are ready for use again! Stain will be gone as long as the water flushes and wipe dry, very convenient. Note: No machine wash. No microwave. You can roll it up for storage or lay it flat in a storage drawer. It can be taken out when in use and will not take up space. Festive Fun - Modern and stylish placemats can be a good decoration for your dining table, kitchens and business office. Perfect for use for both everyday meals and special occasions, such as daily use, family gathering, Thanksgiving, and so on. This placemat set makes a great housewarming, wedding, birthday party, or Christmas present for friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O2im5CMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abuzhen","source_asin":"B0BHQDTMCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191866","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHQDTMCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHQDTMCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191867,"name":"Bamber Rolling Pin Cookie Rolling Pin for Baking Wooden Pastry Pizza Dough Roller, 17.3-Inch Smooth Construction & Easy to Roll - Essential Kitchen Ut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pMtkzzFcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We sincerely welcome any customer to communicate with us if they have any concern of issue on our products. Our service team will be glad to serve you. Remember that customer satisfaction is our top priority! FIRST DIFFERENCE FROM OTHERS: most rolling pins in the market are not well burnished or made of raw material without safe covering, but our rolling pins, featuring remarkable burnishing and covering technique, have incredibly sleek surface and superb handhold feeling. Their top craftsmanship will offer you fantastic rolling experience in kitchen. SECOND DIFFERENCE FROM OTHERS: no dents and small gaps compared with poor burnished or poor covering rolling pins in the market! Poor burnished or poor covering rolling pins have visible small gaps and dents easy to be stuck with flour residue which is difficult to be removed. Our rolling pins have avoided this problem. It is incredibly sleek and leave no room for any residue! TOTALLY ECO IN USE: our rolling pins are all made by selected premium beech wood from Europe. They are totally natural and ECO in use. OFFER UNIQUE ROLLING EXPERIENCE: our rolling pins will give you special rolling experience in the kitchen with their design and quality. We believe you will fall in love with rolling and cooking with our rolling pins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pMtkzzFcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamber","source_asin":"B01485CULE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191867","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01485CULE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01485CULE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191868,"name":"NohaRin 5x6 inch American Countryside Style Wood Picture Frames Made to Display Pictures 3.5x5 Without Mat, With Table Top and Wall Mounting Materials","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418VQV2tKsL._AC_.jpg","description":"1. This is a kind of all solid wood environmental protection picture frame. The border is sprayed with three layers high grade matte PU environmental protection paint, no additional chemical or industrial materials . 2. Wall Mounting Material Include Black S hook and White non-trace nail. 3. The black S hook has been installed on the back of the photo frame. When Hanging the photo frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the frame, conveniently and quickly. 5. It can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. Also great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, and school projects. Good photo frame Solutions in gallery. 6. Three dimension suggests that in turn: The size of the casing outside the poster frame. The picture size without mat . The picture size with mat . 7. The double sided of acrylic sheet cover with protective film, Please torn off when use! 8. Mat is a kind of inside lining paper of print frame, mainly has the effect of ornament, foil, rendering, increase the stereo feeling. 9.Frame border: 1.8 cm wide and 2 cm thick. 10. All size is measured by hand, 2-3 mm error. 11. You can buy LanDing glues to deal with walls with different materials and roughness. such as not smooth hard stone, elegant wallpaper, soft limestone, latex, etc. The viscous force of LanDing glues is very strong, and do not adsorb the wall when take off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418VQV2tKsL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NohaRin","source_asin":"B078J1HP87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191868","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078J1HP87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078J1HP87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":191869,"name":"Amonercvita Black and White Tapestry Burning Sun Tapestry Mountain Tapestry Psychedelic Moon Stars Tapestry Wall Hanging for Bedroom H51×W59","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ylgL8f7JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE: Medium-H51.2\" x W59.1\"(130cm x 150cm); Large-H59.1\" x W78.7\"(150cm x 200cm). BLACK&WHITE: The designer uses bold ideas, smooth lines, classical color matching, outline a crazy but pretty painting, makes this psychedelic sun tapestry so amazing and graceful. HIGH-QUALITY: This Sun and Moon tapestry is made of lightweight polyester fiber, soft, silky, and easy to hang. ALL OCCASION: The black and white mountain tapestry can be used as a hanging for wall, ceiling, TV,sofa background, headboard for bedroom, bed sheet, curtain or table cloth, for decorating, meditation, gift, etc. WASH CARE: Machine washable, please in cold water, under gentle cycle, this hippy sun and mountain tapestry is no color fading, please don’t use bleach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ylgL8f7JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amonercvita","source_asin":"B0874NPC6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0874NPC6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0874NPC6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
