window.products.push({"id":191949,"name":"GARDEN COUTURE Premium 72\" Giant Fiddle Leaf Single Trunk Topiary Artificial Tree + Fiddle Leaf and Grass Foliage in Base + 12” Plant Pot Skirt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alKgU6TZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT: DON'T BUY THIS TREE UNTIL YOU WATCH THE 54 Second video showing you exactly How To Bend and Shape The Leaves which follows the 6 display pictures on this Amazon Ad. There is a heavy wire along the spine of each Giant Fiddle Leaf which you Press and Bend with one hand on top and one underneath along the leaf until you achieve the exact shape you desire. You MUST NOT BEND the leaf where it joins the trunk as that is its weakest point (just like on a real tree) and is not meant to be bent from there. The video is essential, so you don't damage any part of the Tree. MORE IN EVERY ASPECT: THIS Premium FIDDLE LEAF FIG Artificial Tree Has More than 28 GIANT DETAILED Leaves of the HIGHEST QUALTY, and a Bigger and Heavier Pot Base for More Stability. DELUXE WITH NO MAINTENANCE: This Premium FIDDLE LEAF FIG tree is a Beautiful Imitation of the Real Thing WIDER TALLER AND HEAVIER: And that’s just the Base we’re talking about! The 8-inch Base is 45% Wider and Twice as Heavy to Make it More Stable. This Artificial Fake Fiddle Leaf Tree Weighs 20.5 lbs Enabling it to Stand on its Own. LIFE LIKE LEAVES: The are More Than 28 Premium GIANT FIDDLE LEAF leaves Including the additional Foliage arrangement included in the Base. HOME AND OFFICE: It Requires No Maintenance and is Perfect For Your Home or Office With No Limit To Improving Your Overall Décor. Also Perfect For All Events either Indoor or Outdoor. BEAUTIFUL FINISH: A Combination of Premium Beautifully Detailed Fiddle Leaf Leaves and Tropical Grasses have Been Included in The Base Of The Tree. A BONUS Plant Pot Skirt is not only Beautiful, it is Bio Degradable. The 12 inch Wide and Tall 600 GSM Origami Styled Plant Pot Surround is like Fashion for your Plant Pot will complete the Deluxe look in your Home or Office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71alKgU6TZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GARDEN COUTURE","source_asin":"B09GDS27K5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GDS27K5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GDS27K5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
