window.products.push({"id":191951,"name":"SearchI Stretch Club Chair Slipcover 2 Piece, Soft Removable Printed Tub Chair Slipcover, Non Slip Barrel Chair Slipcovers, Club Chair Cover for Livin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iGKhu-xaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM FABRIC】Made of high-quality polyester and spandex material, SearchI club chair slipcover features feature excellent characteristics of softness, stretch and durability. the barrel Chair Slipcover is knitted with excellent textile technics and will ensure every neat and fine stitch. Processed with reactive dyeing process，the club chair won`t fades easily and will keep intact even after repeated use. 【HIGHLY FIT】With upgraded two piece design, there is no need to worry about foam sticks popping out again, which means less trouble and cozier leisure. Also, high elasticity fabric and elastic straps on the bottom will keep the club chair slipcovers staying in place more firmly. Club chair height 27.6-35.4\", Chair width:27.6-31.5\", Seat Depth: 18.1-22.1\",Backrest Height: 14.9-18.9\". Kindly measure your club sofa before ordering.(Please allow 0.5-1 inch error due to manual measurement) 【PERFECT CHAIR PROTECTOR】SearchI club chair cover with cushion cover can ensure your club chair fully covered. In addition to protecting your club chair from abrasion, tears and pets scratches. It will rehabilitate old tub chair and you don't need to spend more money to replace the chair. 【GORGEOUS DESIGN】SearchI tub chair cover features fashion pattern design which present you a new visual look and feeling. It will freshen up your vintage chair and go well with your indoor decoration theme perfectly, the premium club chair cover is absolutely a harmonious combination of fashion and elegance which will bring you more blissful moments at home. 【THOUGHTFUL TIPS】Wash in cold water and gentle cycle separately, tumble dry low, do not bleach or iron, then you will get an intact barrel chair cover almost like a new one. Please contact us freely if any questions about products. We continue to improve our responsiveness in Customer Service to your issues, and we manage to provide satisfactory service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iGKhu-xaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SearchI","source_asin":"B09MPNY3CW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-191951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MPNY3CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MPNY3CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
